  "visualBrief": "Minin stands in a belted tunic with one open hand raised. Pozharsky rises from his seat with the round shield while both figures hold the upright sword. The red granite pedestal has a gilt dedication and two distinct bronze reliefs, an assembly of donors on the front and a mounted group on the rear.",
  "heightPolicy": "The standard terrain anchor is 148 m above sea level. The granite footing extends beneath the surrounding grade and the lowest step rises above the rendered pavement.",
